{"seq":1,"slug":"server-side-impl-hermes","title":"hermes mcp serve：server 端实现","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/mcp-bidirectional/server-side-impl-hermes","wordCount":1000,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"hermes-mcp-serve-server-端实现\">hermes mcp serve：server 端实现</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>hermes mcp serve</code> 把 Hermes 的核心能力——长期记忆、curator 状态、persona、skill dispatch——封装成 MCP server 暴露出去。这是 Tier 2 personal-agent 工具栈区别于 Tier 1 coding-tools 的关键设计：Tier 1 工具用 MCP 作 client 调用外部 server，Tier 2 用 MCP <strong>作 server</strong> 把自己的&quot;软上下文&quot;暴露给 Tier 1 反向调用。stdio-first 设计保证数据不出本机，5 个核心 tool 各有 input/output schema，让 Claude Code / Codex 等 client 能用 structured tool result 直接消费。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[Claude Code] --&gt; S[stdio JSON-RPC]&#10;  B[Codex] --&gt; S&#10;  S --&gt; H[hermes mcp serve]&#10;  H --&gt; M[memory_query]&#10;  H --&gt; W[memory_write]&#10;  H --&gt; C[curator_schedule_list]&#10;  H --&gt; P[persona_active]&#10;  H --&gt; D[skill_dispatch]&#10;  M --&gt; X[SQLite FTS5]&#10;  W --&gt; Y[MEMORY.md]&#10;  P --&gt; Z[persona registry]\">flowchart LR\n  A[Claude Code] --&gt; S[stdio JSON-RPC]\n  B[Codex] --&gt; S\n  S --&gt; H[hermes mcp serve]\n  H --&gt; M[memory_query]\n  H --&gt; W[memory_write]\n  H --&gt; C[curator_schedule_list]\n  H --&gt; P[persona_active]\n  H --&gt; D[skill_dispatch]\n  M --&gt; X[SQLite FTS5]\n  W --&gt; Y[MEMORY.md]\n  P --&gt; Z[persona registry]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计选择</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>stdio over HTTP</td>\n<td>本地优先，数据不出本机，无 audience 校验复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 个 tool 而非更多</td>\n<td>控制 client 端 schema 复杂度，避免选择疲劳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全部带 outputSchema</td>\n<td>client 可解析 typed 字段而非裸字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认 read-heavy</td>\n<td>memory_write 是唯一写操作，其余 read-only</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"tool-列表与职责\">tool 列表与职责</h2><h3 id=\"memory_query\">memory_query</h3><p>按 FTS5 检索 Hermes 长期记忆。Input：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;query&quot;: &quot;rpc OR kitex NOT deprecated&quot;,&#10;  &quot;top_k&quot;: 10,&#10;  &quot;filters&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;bytedance&quot;, &quot;rpc&quot;],&#10;    &quot;min_importance&quot;: 0.5,&#10;    &quot;since&quot;: &quot;2026-04-01&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;rank_mode&quot;: &quot;bm25_importance&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rpc OR kitex NOT deprecated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"top_k\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"filters\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bytedance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rpc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"min_importance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"since\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-04-01\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rank_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bm25_importance\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Output（structured 字段）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;entries&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;entry_id&quot;: &quot;mem_8a3f&quot;,&#10;      &quot;title&quot;: &quot;字节内部 RPC 服务必须用 bytedance-golang-expert&quot;,&#10;      &quot;body_excerpt&quot;: &quot;处理任何...&quot;,&#10;      &quot;score&quot;: 0.87,&#10;      &quot;importance&quot;: 0.91,&#10;      &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;workflow&quot;, &quot;bytedance&quot;, &quot;rpc&quot;],&#10;      &quot;last_hit_at&quot;: &quot;2026-05-10T09:42:00Z&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;total_matched&quot;: 23,&#10;  &quot;query_ms&quot;: 4.7&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entries\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"entry_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mem_8a3f\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"字节内部 RPC 服务必须用 bytedance-golang-expert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"body_excerpt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"处理任何...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.87</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"importance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.91</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workflow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bytedance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rpc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"last_hit_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-10T09:42:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"total_matched\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">23</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"query_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>详细 FTS5 语法见 <a href=\"../persistent-memory/fts5-search-and-retrieval\"><code>../1_persistent-memory/3_fts5-search-and-retrieval.md</code></a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"memory_write\">memory_write</h3><p>把一条新记忆写进 MEMORY.md（cold storage 区，后续 curator 决定是否升 hot）。Input：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;lark-cli token 一年过期一次&quot;,&#10;  &quot;body&quot;: &quot;每年 5 月需要重新 lark-cli auth login...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;lark&quot;, &quot;workflow&quot;],&#10;  &quot;source&quot;: &quot;claude_code_session&quot;,&#10;  &quot;initial_importance&quot;: 0.6&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lark-cli token 一年过期一次\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"每年 5 月需要重新 lark-cli auth login...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lark\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workflow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claude_code_session\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"initial_importance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Output：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;entry_id&quot;: &quot;mem_9b21&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;written&quot;,&#10;  &quot;location&quot;: &quot;cold_storage&quot;,&#10;  &quot;curator_eta&quot;: &quot;2026-05-15T03:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entry_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mem_9b21\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"written\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"location\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cold_storage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"curator_eta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-15T03:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>是唯一一个修改 state 的 tool。Hermes 在 server 端做 dedup pre-check：如果新条目与已有 entry embedding similarity &gt; 0.92，返回 <code>status: &quot;deduplicated&quot;</code> 并附 existing entry_id，避免 client 反复写入同一事实。</p>\n<h3 id=\"curator_schedule_list\">curator_schedule_list</h3><p>返回最近 N 次 curator run 的状态与 metric snapshot。Input：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{ &quot;limit&quot;: 10, &quot;since&quot;: &quot;2026-04-01&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"since\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-04-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Output：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;runs&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;run_id&quot;: &quot;cur_2026-05-13&quot;,&#10;      &quot;started_at&quot;: &quot;2026-05-13T03:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;      &quot;duration_ms&quot;: 1830,&#10;      &quot;reranks&quot;: 142,&#10;      &quot;dedupes&quot;: 4,&#10;      &quot;retires&quot;: 2,&#10;      &quot;next_scheduled&quot;: &quot;2026-05-14T03:00:00Z&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"runs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"run_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cur_2026-05-13\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"started_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-13T03:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"duration_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1830</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reranks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">142</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dedupes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"retires\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"next_scheduled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-14T03:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>提供给 client 的目的是让 client &quot;知道记忆系统什么状态&quot;——例如 Claude Code 在做关键操作前可以先 <code>curator_schedule_list</code>，发现 next_scheduled 在 5 分钟内，决定推迟写入避免 race。</p>\n<h3 id=\"persona_active\">persona_active</h3><p>返回当前 active persona 元数据。Output：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;persona_id&quot;: &quot;tech-lead&quot;,&#10;  &quot;soul_excerpt&quot;: &quot;简短直接,决策给 2-3 个 trade-off...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;user_excerpt&quot;: &quot;时区 Asia/Shanghai,母语中文...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tool_whitelist&quot;: [&quot;bytedance-golang-expert&quot;, &quot;lark-cli&quot;],&#10;  &quot;activated_at&quot;: &quot;2026-05-14T08:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"persona_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tech-lead\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"soul_excerpt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"简短直接,决策给 2-3 个 trade-off...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"user_excerpt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"时区 Asia/Shanghai,母语中文...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tool_whitelist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bytedance-golang-expert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lark-cli\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"activated_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-14T08:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>让 Tier 1 client 知道&quot;用户当前正在以哪个角色工作&quot;，从而对齐自己的输出风格与工具选择。</p>\n<h3 id=\"skill_dispatch\">skill_dispatch</h3><p>让 client 触发 Hermes 已注册的某个 skill。Input：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;skill_name&quot;: &quot;weekly-report-base-to-doc&quot;,&#10;  &quot;context&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;base_id&quot;: &quot;bascn123&quot;,&#10;    &quot;week_start&quot;: &quot;2026-05-10&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"skill_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"weekly-report-base-to-doc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"context\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"base_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bascn123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"week_start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-10\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Output：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;invocation_id&quot;: &quot;inv_3c8f&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;started&quot;,&#10;  &quot;skill_version&quot;: &quot;1.1.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;estimated_steps&quot;: 4&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"invocation_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inv_3c8f\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"started\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"skill_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"estimated_steps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意：这是异步 dispatch，不阻塞 client。Skill 执行进度可通过 <code>inv_3c8f</code> 查 Hermes status endpoint，或订阅 hermes outbound webhook 接收完成事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"stdio-first-设计原因\">stdio-first 设计原因</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>stdio</th>\n<th>HTTP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>部署</td>\n<td>子进程直接启动</td>\n<td>需起 daemon + 监听 port</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鉴权</td>\n<td>进程父子关系隐含信任</td>\n<td>必须 token + audience 校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据流向</td>\n<td>本地 unix domain</td>\n<td>可能走网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试</td>\n<td>tcpdump 不可见</td>\n<td>易抓包泄露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多 client</td>\n<td>每个 client 自己启子进程</td>\n<td>单 daemon 多 client</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Tier 2 选 stdio 是因为 memory / persona 包含用户最敏感的&quot;软资产&quot;——把这些通过 HTTP 暴露需要严格 audience / token 管理才安全，反而比 stdio 更复杂。代价是不能跨主机：Claude Code 在另一台机器要用 Hermes memory，必须 SSH tunnel 或显式 HTTP 模式（<code>hermes mcp serve --http</code>，需要额外配置 token）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tier-1-client-接入示例\">Tier 1 client 接入示例</h2><h3 id=\"claude-code\">Claude Code</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// ~/.claude/mcp-servers/hermes.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;command&quot;: &quot;hermes&quot;,&#10;  &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;mcp&quot;, &quot;serve&quot;],&#10;  &quot;env&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;HERMES_HOME&quot;: &quot;~/.learnwy/hermes&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ~/.claude/mcp-servers/hermes.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hermes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"args\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mcp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"serve\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"env\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"HERMES_HOME\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"~/.learnwy/hermes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启动 Claude Code 后 <code>claude mcp list</code> 应看到 hermes 在列。</p>\n<h3 id=\"codex-cli\">Codex CLI</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# ~/.codex/config.toml&#10;[[mcp_servers]]&#10;name = &quot;hermes&quot;&#10;command = &quot;hermes&quot;&#10;args = [&quot;mcp&quot;, &quot;serve&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># ~/.codex/config.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[mcp_servers]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name = \"hermes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>command = \"hermes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>args = [\"mcp\", \"serve\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两者都用 stdio，配置 schema 略有差异但语义一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"input-output-schema-完整声明\">input/output schema 完整声明</h2><p>每个 tool 都按 MCP spec 声明 <code>inputSchema</code> 与 <code>outputSchema</code>，让 client 能在 IDE / runtime 做静态校验：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;memory_query&quot;,&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Search Hermes long-term memory via FTS5&quot;,&#10;  &quot;inputSchema&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,&#10;    &quot;required&quot;: [&quot;query&quot;],&#10;    &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;query&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot; },&#10;      &quot;top_k&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;integer&quot;, &quot;default&quot;: 10, &quot;maximum&quot;: 100 },&#10;      &quot;filters&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot; },&#10;      &quot;rank_mode&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;, &quot;enum&quot;: [&quot;bm25&quot;, &quot;bm25_importance&quot;, &quot;recency&quot;] }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;outputSchema&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,&#10;    &quot;required&quot;: [&quot;entries&quot;],&#10;    &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;entries&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;array&quot;, &quot;items&quot;: { &quot;$ref&quot;: &quot;#/$defs/Entry&quot; } },&#10;      &quot;total_matched&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;integer&quot; },&#10;      &quot;query_ms&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;number&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"memory_query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Search Hermes long-term memory via FTS5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"inputSchema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"top_k\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"integer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maximum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"filters\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rank_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"enum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bm25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bm25_importance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"outputSchema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"entries\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"entries\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"array\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"$ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#/$defs/Entry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"total_matched\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"integer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"query_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>outputSchema 是 MCP 2025 spec 引入的可选字段——Hermes 全部 tool 都声明它，让 client 不必把 result 当字符串 parse。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>client 配置写错命令路径</strong>：<code>hermes</code> 不在 PATH 时启动失败，错误隐藏在 client log。先 <code>which hermes</code> 确认。</li>\n<li><strong>stdio 模式下 stderr 也走 transport</strong>：Hermes 把 log 默认写 <code>~/.learnwy/hermes/logs/serve.log</code> 而非 stderr，避免污染 JSON-RPC stream。如果日志看不到检查这个文件。</li>\n<li><strong>memory_write 写不进</strong>：可能 dedup 命中，看 output.status 字段。或 hermes 的 SQLite 锁住（同一时刻 curator 在跑），重试一次即可。</li>\n<li><strong>persona_active 返回 null</strong>：用户没切过 persona，没有 default。建议 client 收到 null 时不要直接报错，而是 fallback 到 USER.md 内容。</li>\n<li><strong>跨机器接入</strong>：默认 stdio 不可跨机，需要 <code>--http</code> 模式 + token。详见 hermes 文档 mcp/http 章节。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p><code>hermes mcp serve</code> 用 5 个 tool 把 Hermes 的长期记忆 / curator / persona / skill 能力一一暴露给 Tier 1 client。stdio-first 设计保证数据本地，outputSchema 让 client 解析无歧义，read-heavy + 单一 write tool 的设计让 server 端复杂度可控。这是 Tier 2 personal-agent 工具栈区别于 Tier 1 coding-tools 的&quot;反向 MCP&quot; 关键步骤——下一篇看 OpenClaw 的 MCP server 实现，看它如何在 multi-tenant 隔离要求下做同样的事。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"hermes mcp serve：server 端实现","id":"hermes-mcp-serve-server-端实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"tool 列表与职责","id":"tool-列表与职责"},{"level":3,"text":"memory_query","id":"memory_query"},{"level":3,"text":"memory_write","id":"memory_write"},{"level":3,"text":"curator_schedule_list","id":"curator_schedule_list"},{"level":3,"text":"persona_active","id":"persona_active"},{"level":3,"text":"skill_dispatch","id":"skill_dispatch"},{"level":2,"text":"stdio-first 设计原因","id":"stdio-first-设计原因"},{"level":2,"text":"Tier 1 client 接入示例","id":"tier-1-client-接入示例"},{"level":3,"text":"Claude Code","id":"claude-code"},{"level":3,"text":"Codex CLI","id":"codex-cli"},{"level":2,"text":"input/output schema 完整声明","id":"input-output-schema-完整声明"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Skill 版本管理与 rollback","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/skills-self-creation/skill-versioning-and-rollback"},"next":{"title":"openclaw mcp serve：multi-tenant 隔离的 server 实现","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/mcp-bidirectional/server-side-impl-openclaw"}}